example:
两边使用同一对 version 和 group。协议显式写成 tri：

```java
@DubboService(version = "1.0.0", group = "order")
public class InventoryServiceImpl implements InventoryService {
    @Override
    public void deduct(String sku, int qty) {
        stock.deduct(sku, qty);
    }
}
```

```java
@DubboReference(version = "1.0.0", group = "order", timeout = 1000, retries = 0)
private InventoryService inventory;
```

```yaml
dubbo:
  application:
    name: inventory
  registry:
    address: nacos://127.0.0.1:8848
  protocol:
    name: tri
    port: 50051
```
